This product includes software developed as a learning project that
implements, in simplified form, the following publicly specified ideas:

- Model Context Protocol (MCP), JSON-RPC 2.0 based tool protocol.
  The implementation here is an educational re-implementation, not the
  official SDK. See https://modelcontextprotocol.io
- RDF / RDFS / OWL style ontology concepts (rdf:type, rdfs:subClassOf,
  rdfs:domain, rdfs:range, owl:inverseOf, owl:TransitiveProperty,
  owl:SymmetricProperty, owl:disjointWith) in reduced form.

